Nepal GRM — Grievance Redress Mechanism platform
================================================

A grievance redress mechanism for ADB-financed road infrastructure in Nepal
(Kakarbhitta–Laukahi Road, ADB Loan 52097-003): multilingual chatbot intake by
text and voice, an officer ticketing workflow with enforced service-level
deadlines and escalation to a Grievance Redress Committee, and an
access-isolated SEAH (sexual exploitation, abuse and harassment) stream.

